# Mode two: "Return target Cave card from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped." Bot1's graveyard holds Fabled Passage (a land, not a Cave - turn 1, sacrificed
# for a Forest) and Promising Vein (a Cave - turn 3, sacrificed with a Mox Jet's {1} for another Forest). Glimpse the Core cannot target the Passage (the refusal)
# and returns the Vein (the positive control), tapped. The Passage stays in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Fabled Passage
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Glimpse the Core
Promising Vein
Island
Forest
Forest
Forest
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Fabled Passage.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Fabled Passage.Activate
Bot1.Search(Forest)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Promising Vein.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Promising Vein.Activate(Ability: Search)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Search(Forest)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Glimpse the Core.Cast
Bot1.Modes(2)
! Bot1.Target(Fabled Passage)
Bot1.Target(Promising Vein)

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Glimpse the Core; Fabled Passage
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Forest; Promising Vein; Mox Emerald; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby
Bot1.Battlefield.Promising Vein.Tapped = true
